{%- comment -%}
  House of Agha · About 02b · Composed in Hyderabad
  The house's city, told through its own lines: a detailed Charminar line drawing (vector
  paths from tools/charminar-svg.js, not a photo) that builds itself from the ground up as the
  section scrolls in: each tier's lines draw, then its arched openings fill in, the city's name in Urdu
  (حیدرآباد) behind it, a Qutub Shahi arcade frieze (assets/hoa-qutub.svg) along the card edge,
  and three heritage notes (blocks). Set on a warm sand panel with an inset gold hairline,
  like a manuscript page. The drawing follows the scroll: it starts as its ground line
  enters the screen and completes while the card is pinned below the navbar. Complete and fully drawn without JS; motion in assets/hoa-about.js.
  Copy is city heritage, editable in the theme editor.
{%- endcomment -%}
